  "description": "CrisperWhisper 2.0 is an open-weight multilingual automatic speech recognition (ASR) system built on Whisper. It provides controllable transcription styles (verbatim or intended), highly accurate word-level timestamps, forced alignment, long-form transcription without chunk artifacts, and production-ready inference with speculative decoding.",
  "keyFeatures": [
    "Verbatim transcription preserving fillers, repetitions, false starts, cut-offs and vocal events",
    "Intended transcription producing clean readable text",
    "Precise word-level timestamps (~30 ms boundary error)",
    "Forced alignment",
    "Verbatimize existing clean transcripts",
    "Multilingual transcription",
    "Conditional continuation for seamless long recordings",
    "Speculative decoding",
    "Looping hallucination mitigation",
    "CPU and GPU inference",
    "CTranslate2 backend",
    "PyTorch backend"
